<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 14.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 14.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympic Melody (built 1984) 29,640 dwt prompt del Antwerp prompt tripl USG $7,500 Combac.</p>
<p>Timios Stavros (built 1978) 64,370 dwt USG/China $13.205 daily $275,000 bonus Glencore.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
